OL,3,GNEWSARed plaque honours firefighting   
OL,4,Awar veteran                            
OL,6,FA firefighter who avoided capture      
OL,7,Fduring World War Two by hiding up a    
OL,8,Ftree and later died during fire station
OL,9,Fdrills has been honoured.              
OL,11,FWilliam McHarry from Workington,       
OL,12,FCumbria, joined Sunderland Fire Brigade
OL,13,Fafter serving with the RAF and later   
OL,14,Fbecame a representative of the Fire    
OL,15,FBrigades Union (FBU).                  
OL,17,FHe died following a cardiac arrest     
OL,18,Fduring training at Fulwell Fire Station
OL,19,Fin Sunderland on 17 November 1970, aged
OL,20,F49.                                    
