OL,3,GNEWSARed plaque honours firefighting   
OL,4,Awar veteran                            
OL,6,FA ceremony was held this week at The   
OL,7,FFire Station in High Street West,      
OL,8,FSunderland, where a red plaque was     
OL,9,Funveiled.                              
